From 7e174f44c5bf892a3ca64e21ea631ccfc81bca05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 02:37:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(yocv): default port 4174, PathFinder keeps 4173

The connected journey runs all four prototypes on one laptop. PathFinder
and YoCV both defaulted to 4173, so YoCV moves to 4174 (journey contract
v1, Addresses). PORT still overrides it. The run guides, the handover
pack and the demo script now open port 4174. Older plans, specs and the
testing log keep 4173 as the record of what was run then.

npm test (YOCV_LIVE_YOMA=0, Node 22): tests 654, pass 622, fail 0,
skipped 4, cancelled 28. The 28 cancelled are the provider timeout
tests in tests/anthropic.test.cjs and tests/providers.test.cjs, which
cancel the same way on main in this environment.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YcQNX4S5GbGG8rboP8226e
